      "value": "If it is your private instance, you have instance moderation powers, so you can kick them out and they won't be able to re-join for an hour.\n\nOtherwise, consider creating a Group and using a Group Public or Group+ instance instead. You can ban users from your group, and they will be completely unable to enter the instances that belong to that group.",
