      "value": "@{6355470543d416450ca9c19a|full_name}, but what the opening post is explaining is an issue with the world's scripting. Which a world creator doesn't even have the ability or incentive to fix.\n\nThe world creator cannot see if you have someone blocked through the Udon scripting, and exposing that to the world creator could be abused.\n\nBanning someone from your group's instances will cause a lot less drama than the world popping up a warning message saying \"two players have each other blocked, cannot start game.\" This will clearly just lead to witch hunts and heated arguments as people find out who has blocked who and why.\n\nIt is much much simpler to just use the instance and group moderation tools that VRChat has already provided to solve this issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
