      "value": "@{610d538d5303a82960a415b4|full_name}\n\nNo, this is about not wanting to add blocked users to \"my own instances\".\n\nThe world creator is not involved in this issue.\n\nAnd making all instances Group instances isn't practical.\n\nCreating Groups and Group instances in the way you want requires a Plus subscription. However, that is not fair.\n\nIn short, the solution is to prevent users blocked by the instance owner from viewing that instance.\n\nThis is a forum for requesting features, so there's no need to discuss this further.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
