      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6355470543d416450ca9c19a|full_name}, if it is a normal Public instance, the world's creator is set as the instance owner. So that wouldn't work either.\n\nWithout using Group instances, it will only work if it is a private (F+/F/I+/I) instance, which would then mean you have moderation powers and can just kick them.\n\nYou are correct that you need to have VRC+ to create a group, I didn't think of that. Thankfully you don't need to keep it after the group has been created.",
