  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As the title indicates, I need a feature that prevents blocked users from entering my instance.\n\nWhen you create a friend+ instance, the user you blocked comes in through someone else.\n\nIf you block it, you won't be able to see and hear it, but there are times when the flow is broken in the middle or interferes with gameplay in certain worlds because it's visible to others.\n\nI don't mean to bother the user I blocked, I don't want to bother anyone. I just don't want the bad user to blur the mood within the instance.",
